{
  "name": "Cunning Action: Umbral Shroud (Shadowdancer)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to use your Cunning Action to shape the shadows around you into a 30-feet radius sphere around your position. The area inside the sphere counts as dim light and persists for 10 minutes. It disappears early if you become Incapacitated or if its area overlaps with light created by a spell of 3rd level or higher.</p><p>You can only have one Umbral Shroud active at a time.</p>",
